<title>USA: Greater Community Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Greater Community Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>TOTOWA, N.J. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.28		    $0.23</p>
<p> Net			    665			482</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: For Q1 ended March 31, 1997, per share earnings were reported after adjusting for the dilutive effect of outstanding stock options and mandatory stock purchase contracts.</p>
<p>Total assets on March 31, 1997 were $267,047,000 compared to $241,382,000 on the same date in 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name is Greater Community Bancorp, the holding company for Bergen Commercial Bank and Great Falls Bank. It is also the parent of Greater Community Financial LLC, a full service investment brokerage company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
